Mist Xfwm4 theme
----------------
A flat, old-school window frame to go with the Mist GTK theme (gtk-classic-themes). It uses the Mist colours: window #eaeaea,
selection #729fcf, light #ffffff, dark #a4a4a4, and 1 px bevel lines. Title text colours are not set in themerc, so they follow
the GTK theme.

Buttons: menu, stick, shade, hide, maximize and close, with the toggled, pressed and inactive images for each.

License: LGPL-2.1, like the rest of gtk-classic-themes.
